+// `cwnd_after < cwnd_before` here. That only held because, under this frozen
+// virtual clock, per-segment pacing let ONE segment leave per ACK round after
+// warmup; KCC's windowed max-bw filter then aged out and its BDP target
+// collapsed to the cwnd floor (90 -> 4) - on upstream the SAME drop happens on
+// a plain ACK without ECE, so the old assertion never measured the ECN
