+// round, the bandwidth model stays fresh and cwnd stays at the BDP target.
+// The kernel contract for a cong_control CC (BBR/KCC) is: tcp_enter_cwr runs
+// ssthresh() (kcc_ssthresh passes snd_ssthresh through) and tcp_cong_control
+// returns early, so the only ECE window effect is the FSM clamp to the hook's
+// threshold. Assert exactly that, plus a seeded twin run proving ECE never
+// leaves a larger window than the same ACK without ECE. The window CUT on a
+// real CE signal under burst pacing is covered by the wire-level CUBIC case in
+// main() (real-time pump, cwnd_after < cwnd_before).
